OL,3,AStudent: Uni strikes 'not what we
OL,4,Asigned up for'
OL,5,
OL,6,FZoe Monroe, who studies English
OL,7,Fliterature with creative writing, told
OL,8,Fthe BBC the strikes were not what
OL,9,Fstudents had signed up for.
